<title>GERMANY: German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</title>
<headline>German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists the economic and market forecasts for the next six months issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute. The averages are compiled from a survey of 318 firms conducted from April 7 through April 22.</p>
<p>					  Base    Forecast</p>
<p>INFLATION RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    1.5     1.6</p>
<p>    U.S.				 2.8     3.1</p>
<p>    Japan				0.0     0.2</p>
<p>    Britain			    2.6     2.9</p>
<p>    France			     1.1     1.2</p>
<p>    Italy				2.2     2.2</p>
<p>SHORT-TERM RATES (Three-month interbank rates)</p>
<p>    Germany			    3.2     3.3</p>
<p>    U.S.				 5.2     6.2</p>
<p>    Japan				0.6     0.8</p>
<p>    Britain			    6.4     6.9</p>
<p>    France			     3.4     3.5</p>
<p>    Italy				7.0     7.0</p>
<p>LONG-TERM RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    5.9     6.2</p>
<p>    U.S.				 6.9     7.5</p>
<p>    Japan				2.2     2.5</p>
<p>    Britain			    7.6     8.0</p>
<p>    France			     5.8     6.1</p>
<p>    Italy				7.7     8.0</p>
<p>BOURSE</p>
<p>    German DAX			3340    3400</p>
<p>    U.S. Dow Jones		  6640    6620</p>
<p>    Japan Nikkei		   18100   19100</p>
<p>    Britain FT-SE 100	     4300    4300</p>
<p>    France CAC-40		   2570    2650</p>
<p>    Italy MIBtel		   12200   12700</p>
<p>EXCHANGE RATES VS MARK</p>
<p>    Swiss franc		     1.17    1.17</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar		     1.71    1.79</p>
<p>    Japanese yen		    1.36    1.37</p>
<p>    British pound		   2.79    2.81</p>
<p>    French franc		    2.97    2.97</p>
<p>    Italian lira		    1.01    1.00</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
